// A list in a case tuple: `[` elements `]`, each element read as any other
// element of a tuple is (case_item, ../../cimport.id), so `(import NAME)` and a
// nested list are allowed inside one. The node is the plain "arr" an array
// literal in a function body makes, which is what lets the checker and the
// harness treat it as they always have: they already go through fit_value and
// tc_value for each element (mid/names/limits/shape/cases/more/fit/,
// back/tgt/c/out/case/val/value.id), and an element that is a "cimport" is read
// where the list is built -- after the setup for an argument, after the call
// for an expected value.

case_list(int[] pos) {
  advance(pos);
  int[] items = [];
  while(cur_text(pos) != "]" && cur_kind(pos) != "eof") {
    take_item(pos, items);
    skip_text(pos, ",");
  }
} chain (int[] pos) {
  expect_text(pos, "]");
  advance(pos);
  int ret_i = node_arr(items);
} return int ret_i;
given list_fix ([0]):(2) then calls node_arr:([0, 1])
given list_fix ([8]):(2) then calls node_arr:([0])

// Two lists: `[5, (import zz)]` from 0, and `[[5]]` from 8.
list_fix() {
  env_init();
  toks_push(["op", "int", "op", "op", "kw", "ident", "op", "op", "op", "op", "int", "op", "op"], ["[", "5", ",", "(", "import", "zz", ")", "]", "[", "[", "5", "]", "]"]);
} return void;
():() then calls toks_push:(["op", "int", "op", "op", "kw", "ident", "op", "op", "op", "op", "int", "op", "op"], ["[", "5", ",", "(", "import", "zz", ")", "]", "[", "[", "5", "]", "]"])
():() then (import ttext)[5]:("zz")
():() then init_units:(0)

// `given f (1, 2) (3):(4)` from 0 and `given g (3):(4)` from 14: one stream
// with a setup that has arguments and one that has none, for args.id.
gargs_fix() {
  env_init();
  toks_push(["kw", "ident", "op", "int", "op", "int", "op", "op", "int", "op", "op", "op", "int", "op", "kw", "ident", "op", "int", "op", "op", "op", "int", "op"], ["given", "f", "(", "1", ",", "2", ")", "(", "3", ")", ":", "(", "4", ")", "given", "g", "(", "3", ")", ":", "(", "4", ")"]);
} return void;
():() then calls toks_push:(["kw", "ident", "op", "int", "op", "int", "op", "op", "int", "op", "op", "op", "int", "op", "kw", "ident", "op", "int", "op", "op", "op", "int", "op"], ["given", "f", "(", "1", ",", "2", ")", "(", "3", ")", ":", "(", "4", ")", "given", "g", "(", "3", ")", ":", "(", "4", ")"])
():() then (import ttext)[15]:("g")
():() then init_units:(0)
